## ── Generated / build artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep the debug APK in the repo so it can be downloaded directly from GitHub
!app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk
app/build/
# Exclude everything else under build/ (release APKs, intermediates, reports)
**/build/**
!**/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk

## ── Keystore & signing ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
release.properties

## ── Kotlin / Java ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.class
*.jar
# Room KSP generated sources are regenerated at build time
**/generated/ksp/

